 in Moral Theory)#The 2006 Italian preface: MacIntyre's turn to Thomism (directly relevant to this vault)#{2}":[57,57],"#Source: Dopo la virtù (After Virtue: A Study in Moral Theory)#The 2006 Italian preface: MacIntyre's turn to Thomism (directly relevant to this vault)#{3}":[58,58],"#Source: Dopo la virtù (After Virtue: A Study in Moral Theory)#The 2006 Italian preface: MacIntyre's turn to Thomism (directly relevant to this vault)#{4}":[59,59],"#Source: Dopo la virtù (After Virtue: A Study in Moral Theory)#The 2006 Italian preface: MacIntyre's turn to Thomism (directly relevant to this vault)#{5}":[60,60],"#Source: Dopo la virtù (After Virtue: A Study in Moral Theory)#The 2006 Italian preface: MacIntyre's turn to Thomism (directly relevant to this vault)#{6}":[61,62],"#Source: Dopo la virtù (After Virtue: A Study in Moral Theory)#Pages created from this source":[63,68],"#Source: Dopo la virtù (After Virtue: A Study in Moral Theory)#Pages created from this source#{1}":[65,65],"#Source: Dopo la virtù (After Virtue: A Study in Moral Theory)#Pages created from this source#{2}":[66,66],"#Source: Dopo la virtù (After Virtue: A Study in Moral Theory)#Pages created from this source#{3}":[67,68],"#Source: Dopo la virtù (After Virtue: A Study in Moral Theory)#Flagged for follow-up deep ingest":[69,72],"#Source: Dopo la virtù (After Virtue: A Study in Moral Theory)#Flagged for follow-up deep ingest#{1}":[71,72],"#Source: Dopo la virtù (After Virtue: A Study in Moral Theory)#Raw File":[73,76],"#Source: Dopo la virtù (After Virtue: A Study in Moral Theory)#Raw File#{1}":[75,76]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Alasdair MacIntyre","target":"Alasdair MacIntyre","line":13},{"title":"Pratica e Beni Interni","target":"Pratica e Beni Interni","line":14},{"title":"Unità Narrativa della Vita e Tradizione","target":"Unità Narrativa della Vita e Tradizione","line":15},{"title":"San Tommaso d'Aquino","target":"San Tommaso d'Aquino","line":16},{"title":"Tomismo","target":"Tomismo","line":17},{"title":"Pratica e Beni Interni","target":"Pratica e Beni Interni","line":26},{"title":"Unità Narrativa della Vita e Tradizione","target":"Unità Narrativa della Vita e Tradizione","line":26},{"title":"Pratica e Beni Interni","target":"Pratica e Beni Interni","line":49},{"title":"Unità Narrativa della Vita e Tradizione","target":"Unità Narrativa della Vita e Tradizione","line":49},{"title":"Unità Narrativa della Vita e Tradizione","target":"Unità Narrativa della Vita e Tradizione","line":51},{"title":"Unità Narrativa della Vita e Tradizione","target":"Unità Narrativa della Vita e Tradizione","line":59},{"title":"Alasdair MacIntyre","target":"Alasdair MacIntyre","line":65},{"title":"Pratica e Beni Interni","target":"Pratica e Beni Interni","line":66},{"title":"Unità Narrativa della Vita e Tradizione","target":"Unità Narrativa della Vita e Tradizione","line":67},{"title":"San Tommaso d'Aquino","target":"San Tommaso d'Aquino","line":71},{"title":"Tomismo","target":"Tomismo","line":71}],"metadata":{"type":"source","title":"Dopo la virtù","address":"c-000025","created":"2026-07-25","updated":"2026-07-25","tags":["#etica","#source","#book"],"status":"developing","related":["[[Alasdair MacIntyre]]","[[Pratica e Beni Interni]]","[[Unità Narrativa della Vita e Tradizione]]","[[San Tommaso d'Aquino]]","[[Tomismo]]"],"source_type":"book","author":"Alasdair MacIntyre","date_published":"1981 (English, After Virtue); 2nd ed. 1984; 3rd ed. 2007; Italian 2nd ed. 2009 (Armando)","url":"","confidence":"high","key_claims":["Contemporary moral discourse consists of the fragmented survivals of older moral schemes that have lost the context which made them intelligible; hence moral disagreements today are interminable and rhetorically deployed as if objective, though they are actually emotivist in practice.","The Enlightenment project of justifying morality independent of any teleological (Aristotelian) conception of human nature was bound to fail, since it tried to derive rules for a being-as-it-happens-to-be without the intervening conception of a being-as-it-could-be-if-it-realized-its-telos.","A workable account of the virtues requires three nested stages: goods internal to a practice, the narrative unity of a single human life, and a living moral tradition — see [[Pratica e Beni Interni]] and [[Unità Narrativa della Vita e Tradizione]].","Rival traditions of rational enquiry can be judged superior/inferior without a neutral tradition-independent standard, via each tradition's capacity to resolve the rival's own internally-generated unsolved problems — this blocks the charge of relativism."],"raw_file":".raw/A. MacIntyre - Dopo la Virtù.pdf"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Wiki/sources/dopo-la-virtu.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":"1nlssew","at":1785014065444},"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.05401371,0.0528857,-0.00649514,-0.01631534,-0.03219642,-0.00677185,-0.02545631,0.07343818,0.0185224,0.04573013,-0.00306875,-0.01904002,0.05330462,0.02880412,0.07351756,-0.02534296,-0.00385667,0.05030695,-0.01959302,0.02781438,0.11193661,-0.07764016,0.0017156,-0.0047186,0.06568151,0.04069336,-0.0288683,-0.03904424,-0.01025387,-0.18084249,-0.03442631,0.062615,0.015821,-0.01112986,-0.02815963,-0.00081923,-0.04177617,-0.01995532,0.03502391,0.07237343,-0.01605261,-0.02412205,-0.0172518,-0.02278015,-0.03276912,-0.01668447,-0.0340204,-0.02153942,-0.06412103,-0.00867353,-0.06276061,0.02352844,-0.03897573,-0.02037025,-0.02206766,0.06828828,0.01698603,0.06927198,-0.00365494,0.01716618,0.07017148,0.05320744,-0.22799957,0.04557507,0.05295225,0.05837605,-0.03272606,0.06531658,-0.04193663,-0.06184326,-0.06230794,-0.02663671,0.07279904,0.03597921,0.0438992,0.01911825,0.03689268,-0.04816463,-0.02222855,-0.02565035,0.06077601,0.07571223,-0.03483476,0.05786854,-0.0216242,-0.01771491,0.02039308,0.0043119,0.03781042,-0.00183017,-0.02615685,0.00594102,0.06294082,0.020255,-0.03058777,-0.02642154,-0.0281562,0.033